<title>USA: Air France unveils Chicago sale fares.</title>
<headline>Air France unveils Chicago sale fares.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air France of Wednesday unveiled its sale fares from Chicago to more than 50 European cities with rates as low as $204 each way, based on round-trip purchase.</p>
<p>The mid-week winter fares are available for departures from November 1 to March 31, the company said.</p>
<p>The non-refundable tickets must be bought by August 7 and travel must be completed by April 2, 1998, the company said.</p>
</text>
